				171,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Deps): Add upstream PR submission template\n\nAdd a new template file for submitting PRs to upstream dependencies that Land patches locally. The template enforces minimal, backward-compatible changes and includes sections for summary, motivation, changes, breaking changes, use cases, and test plan.\n\nAlso adds a patch tracking table documenting current local patches (e.g., tauri-plugin-localhost with on_request body/handled enhancements) and a process guide for managing local patches versus upstream contributions.\n\nThis standardizes the upstream contribution workflow and ensures patches remain generic and mergeable.",
